@base = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@token = paste-parent-access-token
@student = 1
@main = 1
@savings = 2
@card = 1

### Multi-child dashboard (one call)
GET {{base}}/parent/dashboard/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### A child's profile
GET {{base}}/students/{{student}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Financial literacy tips in my language
GET {{base}}/financial-literacy-tips/?language=en
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Schools of my children (name, branding)
GET {{base}}/my-school/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
